item.description:
Listen to audiobook in full for free : <br><a href="https://amzn.to/4hopIfn">https://amzn.to/4hopIfn</a> <br><br>Title: [Bulgarian] - The 7 Habits of Highly Effective People [Bulgarian Edition]<br>Author: Stephen Covey<br>Narrator: Momchil Stepanov<br>Length: 17:17:50<br>Release date: 12-19-2025<br>Publisher: Authors Republic<br>Genres: Self-Development<br>Language: Bulgarian<br><br>Description:<br>New York Times international bestseller — over 30 million copies sold worldwide!
'The 7 Habits of Highly Effective People' is one of the most influential personal-development books of all time. Stephen R. Covey offers a practical roadmap for anyone who wants to grow, achieve meaningful success, and unlock their full potential.
In this transformative guide, Covey shows how to build a life rooted in fairness, integrity, service, and human dignity — timeless principles that help you stay resilient in times of change and fully seize the opportunities that change creates.
With this audiobook, you will learn how to:
-take ownership of your choices and direction in life;
-strengthen and repair relationships with family, friends, and colleagues;
-increase your productivity and effectiveness;
-create a sustainable work-life balance;
-break unhelpful patterns and develop habits that truly support your goals.
Covey emphasizes that lasting change doesn’t come from fighting bad habits — it comes from cultivating powerful, constructive ones. Good habits often require intention, discipline, and daily practice, but they reshape not only how we see the world, but also how the world responds to us.
Enjoy listening to “The 7 Habits of Highly Effective People” and do not postpone the time to be your happiest self!
Please note: this audiobook is in Bulgarian.<br><br>#ad Disclosure: As an Amazon Associate I earn from qualifying purchases.

